    "body": "Since merging #916 fixed #664 this can now be implemented with custom modules as\r\n\r\n```\r\n[custom.sudo]\r\ncommand = \"echo '(sudo)'\"\r\nwhen = \"sudo -n true\"\r\nstyle = \"#ffb05b\"\r\nprefix = \"\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nNot sure how efficient that is though...",
